# Taste Skill UI Design System & Guidelines (TechGear Pro)

This document establishes the UI design system standards and Taste Skill principles for TechGear Pro. All AI assistants working on frontend components (Storefront, Cart, Checkout, Admin Dashboard) must adhere strictly to these tokens and constraints.

---

## 1. Unified Surface & Signal Color Tokens

### A. Surface Color Hierarchy (`surface.*`)
TechGear Pro uses a calibrated 4-tier dark surface system designed to create optical depth without muddy grays:

- **`surface.canvas` (`#09090b` / `bg-surface-canvas`)**:
  - The root canvas background (`html`, `body`, global app shell).
  - Clean, deep obsidian base replacing fragmented shades like `#07090e`, `#0f172a`, etc.
- **`surface.card` (`#121215` / `bg-surface-card`)**:
  - Standard container background: Product cards, filter panels, summary boxes, data tables.
  - Paired with `.hairline-border` and `.surface-bevel`.
- **`surface.elevated` (`#18181b` / `bg-surface-elevated`)**:
  - Floating UI surfaces: Dropdowns, modal dialogs, popovers, sticky navigation on scroll, tooltips.
- **`surface.subtle` (`#27272a` / `border-surface-subtle`, `bg-surface-subtle`)**:
  - Outlines, section dividers, input backgrounds, disabled chips, subtle hover states (`hover:bg-surface-subtle`).

### B. Signal Color Hierarchy (`signal.*`)
High-contrast, purposeful accent colors reserved strictly for status communication, alerts, and focal micro-interactions. Never use them as broad background fills:

- **`signal.cyan` (`#00F0FF` / `text-signal-cyan`, `border-signal-cyan`, `bg-signal-cyan`)**:
  - Primary high-tech brand accent, active filter chips, focused inputs, focal CTA glow.
- **`signal.emerald` (`#10b981` / `text-signal-emerald`, `bg-signal-emerald/10`)**:
  - "In Stock" (`Còn hàng`), positive price trends, transaction success badges, growth metrics.
- **`signal.amber` (`#f59e0b` / `text-signal-amber`, `bg-signal-amber/10`)**:
  - "Low Stock" (`Chỉ còn 3 cái`), pending orders, promotional flash sale timers, caution states.
- **`signal.rose` (`#f43f5e` / `text-signal-rose`, `bg-signal-rose/10`)**:
  - "Out of Stock" (`Hết hàng`), discount tags (`-25%`), error messages, destructive actions.

